<section class="day-ppl" aria-labelledby="day-died"><h2 class="ref-sec-title" id="day-died">Died on 10 October <span class="n">6</span></h2><ul class="enc-seealso"><li><a href="/encyclopedia/paulinus-of-york"><span class="ph ph-person" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><span class="nm">Paulinus of York</span><span class="tp">d. 644</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/peter-ii-duke-of-bourbon"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/peter-ii-duke-of-bourbon.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Peter II, Duke of Bourbon</span><span class="tp">1438–1503</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/carol-i-of-romania"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/carol-i-of-romania.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Carol I of Romania</span><span class="tp">1839–1914</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/andres-avelino-caceres"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/andres-avelino-caceres.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Andrés Avelino Cáceres</span><span class="tp">1836–1923</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/sirimavo-bandaranaike"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/sirimavo-bandaranaike.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Sirimavo Bandaranaike</span><span class="tp">1916–2000</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/milton-obote"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/milton-obote.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Milton Obote</span><span class="tp">1925–2005</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<p class="day-ppl-note">Dates as the sources give them: in the Julian calendar before 1582, and in some countries for longer (Britain until 1752, Russia until 1918). Only people whose day of birth or death the records agree on are listed.</p>
